# Local dev data -- production data lives entirely in the
# sourcedcs-web-data Docker volume, mounted at /app/data. This directory
# contains real, git-tracked squadron data (pilot-registry.json,
# applications.json, roster.json, ...); baking it into the image would ship
# it in every pushed GHCR layer regardless of the volume mount masking it
# at runtime.
